A||||17||Tweek||Opinions wanted.... Tell me what You think.||||5||
Z||000000||Tweek||02-23-2001||02:04 PM||||Well, lets face it. An 84 Auto is boring, not that much you can do with it to make it go real fast without spending lotsa $$. So, we have other options... The first pic is what the car looks like now. Very boring and plain. It is my only vehicle for now, and because i have to drive it in the winter I decided to leave the orignal base rims on with new snows. Come spring I'll look into bigger and better wheels. And yes, I know that im missing the tailpipe tipe, broke off due to rust the day i bought it...  lol. Oh, the decklid is from a later year... obviously.  Ok, Ive always been known as a kinda wierd guy that doesnt care too much about what people think about him. The last 3 pictures are what i would like the car to look like during the summer. By either painting the existing parts or going to a bone yard and getting extras and painting those instead.<P>So...   Do I get:<BR>A: Way cool.<BR>B: Acceptibly weird.<BR>C: Too ugly to bother with.<P>  <IMG SRC="http://www.geocities.com/myseries1/fiero/boring.jpg">  <BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.geocities.com/myseries1/fiero/b-w_front.jpg">  <BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.geocities.com/myseries1/fiero/wheels-gas-air.jpg">  <BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.geocities.com/myseries1/fiero/b-w_rear.jpg">  <P>Thanks for letting me know what you think...<P>-Ted<p>[This message has been edited by Tweek (edited 02-23-2001).]||||reg||5
Z||000001||Gold-86SE||02-23-2001||02:15 PM||||<BR>I am fond of maintaining the Fiero's original state, within respectable modifications (performance enhancements, not body changes).<P>I don't really care for the highlights you encluded.  If it was mine, I would replace the wheels with hi-tech turbo or some awesome looking performance aftermarket wheels.<P>I like black on the Fiero, I would play to that theme.<P>Just my $0.02<P>------------------<BR>84 SE 4.10 4 Speed (Cold and Rain Daily Driver)<BR>85 GT Automatic (Restoration Project)<BR>86 SE 4 Speed (Fair Weather Daily Driver)<BR>87 SC 5 Speed (Not Running, V8 Conversion?)<BR>Please visit my <A HREF="http://www.trifocus.net/~fws/index.html" TARGET=_blank>Fiero Work Shop</A>||||reg||1
