Z||000005||2xsess||02-23-2001||02:26 PM||||ok, now am I the only one that isn't seeing the pictures?<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/boring.jpg"> <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/b-w_front.jpg"> <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/b-w_rear.jpg"> <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/wheels-gas-air.jpg"> <P>There, if they show up for everyone else on the first post say so and I'll remove these so the thread doesn't take even longer to load. <P>I'm not sure what to say about your ideas, it's your car and if that's what you want to do , do it.<BR>I like the wheels. Not really sure about the headlight doors. Kind of looks like it was wrecked and you haven't painted them yet. <P><P>------------------<BR>Jeff<BR>AOL IM : Only2xsess<BR>       <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/2xsess.gif">      <BR> <A HREF="http://kresgeus.homestead.com/FieroPage.html" TARGET=_blank>Visit My Website</A>||||reg||1
